    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Arcane Cascade]</p>\n<p>Your melee Strikes gain the arcane trait and deal 1 extra force damage, and you gain resistance 1 to damage from spells. If you have the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Weapon Specialization] class feature, the damage and resistance increase to 2, and if you have @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Greater Weapon Specialization], they increase to 3.</p>\n<p>If you Cast a Spell and then enter Arcane Cascade on the same turn, you can change the damage from the stance to any one damage type that spell could deal instead of force.</p>"
        },
